; The complete list of ntoskrnl.exe functions gm20b.sys imports.  win/tests/verify_pe.py fails the build if the
; linked driver imports anything that is not listed here (every one of them is a documented WDK routine).
LIBRARY ntoskrnl.exe
EXPORTS
ZwCreateFile
ZwWriteFile
ZwClose
ZwFlushBuffersFile
ZwOpenKey
ZwQueryValueKey
ZwSetValueKey
ZwFlushKey
MmMapIoSpaceEx
MmUnmapIoSpace
MmAllocateContiguousMemorySpecifyCache
MmFreeContiguousMemory
MmGetPhysicalAddress
KeStallExecutionProcessor
KeDelayExecutionThread
KeQueryPerformanceCounter
IoCreateDevice
IoDeleteDevice
IoCreateSymbolicLink
IoDeleteSymbolicLink
IofCompleteRequest
